1
00:05:51,428 --> 00:05:57,428
Are you ready to live the life you deserve?

2
00:11:42,857 --> 00:11:48,857
Don't Worry Darling is a science fiction, mystery,
thriller film directed by Olivia Wilde.

3
00:17:34,285 --> 00:17:40,285
Alice and Jack are lucky to be living in the idealized community of Victory, the experimental company
town housing the men who work for the top-secret Victory Project and their families.

4
00:23:25,714 --> 00:23:31,714
But when cracks in their idyllic life begin to appear, exposing flashes of something much more sinister lurking
beneath the attractive façade, Alice can’t help questioning exactly what they’re doing in Victory, and why.

5
00:29:17,142 --> 00:29:23,142
Alice, played by Florence Pugh.

6
00:35:08,571 --> 00:35:14,571
Jack, played by Harry Styles.

7
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:06,000
Frank, played by Chris Pine.

8
00:46:51,428 --> 00:46:57,428
Bunny, played by Olivia Wilde.

9
00:52:42,857 --> 00:52:48,857
Margaret, played by KiKi Layne.

10
00:58:34,285 --> 00:58:40,285
Shelley, played by Gemma Chan.

11
01:04:25,714 --> 01:04:31,714
Don't Worry Darling is a 2022 American psychological thriller film directed by Olivia Wilde from a
screenplay by Katie Silberman, based on a spec script by brothers Carey Van Dyke and Shane Van Dyke.

12
01:10:17,142 --> 01:10:23,142
Starring Florence Pugh, Harry Styles, Olivia Wilde, Gemma Chan, KiKi Layne, Nick Kroll, and Chris Pine, it follows a housewife in an
idyllic company town who begins to suspect a sinister secret being kept from its residents by the man who runs it.

13
01:16:08,571 --> 01:16:14,571
Following the critical success of Wilde's feature directorial debut Booksmart (2019), a multi-studio
bidding war took place for her second film, with New Line Cinema eventually winning.

14
01:22:00,000 --> 01:22:06,000
Pugh joined the cast in April 2020, with Styles added that September,
replacing Shia LaBeouf after production had already begun.

15
01:27:51,428 --> 01:27:57,428
Filming took place in Los Angeles from October 2020 to February 2021.

16
01:33:42,857 --> 01:33:48,857
The film was the subject of media attention and controversy, including conflicting reports regarding
the circumstances of LaBeouf's departure and alleged conflicts between Wilde and Pugh.

17
01:39:34,285 --> 01:39:40,285
Don't Worry Darling premiered at the 79th Venice International Film Festival on September 5, 2022,
and was theatrically released in the United States on September 23 by Warner Bros.

18
01:45:25,714 --> 01:45:31,714
It received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $87.6 million.

19
01:51:17,142 --> 01:51:23,142
The film explores themes of suburbian idyll, cult, palm
springs, psychological thriller, stepford wife.

20
01:57:08,571 --> 01:57:14,571
The tone is intense and lighthearted and thought_provoking.
